## html/author (warning)

an article names no author for its link preview

Where: 6 pages of group default (100 %), for example:
- /about
- /duplicate
- /orphan
Reads: `html.author`, expects `{"type":"string","minLength":1}`
Fix: Add <meta name=author>, article:author, or a JSON-LD author to the article head.
Docs: https://github.com/mastodon/mastodon/blob/423d0ca875fccbcd02ed4201999cec1625dee9e6/app/lib/link_details_extractor.rb#L195-L197
Done when: `spiderlint audit ORIGIN/ --rules html/author` reports no html/author finding.

## html/published-date (warning)

an article gives no publication date for its link preview

Where: 6 pages of group default (100 %), for example:
- /about
- /duplicate
- /orphan
Reads: `html.published`, expects `{"type":"string","minLength":1}`
Fix: Add <meta property=article:published_time> or a JSON-LD datePublished in ISO 8601.
Docs: https://ogp.me/#type_article
Done when: `spiderlint audit ORIGIN/ --rules html/published-date` reports no html/published-date finding.

